Subject: [PATCH] KosmicKrisp 2026-07-10 to 2026-07-13
kk: Metal's precise functions are only fp32
kk: Use safe math for nir_fp_no_reassoc
kk: Implement VK_KHR_shader_float_controls2
kk: Refactor encoder state
kk: Expose shaderSignedZeroInfNanPreserveFloat16/32
kk: Compile all shaders with fast math
kk: Use isnan(x) for x != x and !isnan(x) for x == x
kk: Handle per alu math controls in MSL
kk: Fix metal import assert
---
